{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"notes\": {\n    \"甲\": \"甲版解释清楚了温暖重新鲜活为何使失去更难承受、无法否认美好又无法接受失去为何催生反复追问，以及追问无效如何加剧紧绷，并指出身体的催迫可以先于自问出现；但它对108–115从温柔转向风暴的具体机制、身体如何由紧绷转为疲惫，以及反复思考如何从寻找答案变成避免停下的应对方式，解释得较为概括。\",\n    \"乙\": \"乙版把过去的美好正在流逝的警觉如何侵入当下的温柔、郑重与克制为何能暂时稳住自己却不能消除不安、身体为何先于念头急起来又因持续用力而疲惫，以及思考如何接过身体无法继续承担的任务并转为避免停下的办法，连成了较完整的因果链；但它没有具体解释半音阶下行如何形成与向前追赶相反的后退力量，对音乐转折的说明仍偏重心理叙事。\"\n  },\n  \"verdict\": \"乙 版不差于 甲 版\",\n  \"why\": \"乙版不仅保留了甲版关于温暖加深失落、追问循环和身体先紧的解释，还更清楚地说明了应对方式为何暂时有效却增加消耗，以及反复思考如何从求解转为逃避停顿，因此在解释感受形成与变化的机制上不逊于甲版。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3edbbf39-8ada-41e0-8790-e3ddc606a96c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T135159362897Z", "elapsed_seconds": 91.031, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:53:30.404648+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2d02c5744f79d0cba6193d8066340438670966b21f8ec271593f57747099986b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2